<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-10-17T11:01:31.660Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:01:31 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila has formally allied with the M23 rebels, expanding the anti-government coalition that is now attacking the Congolese army in North Kivu. Security personnel linked to Erik Prince were ambushed, resulting in the death of a former New Zealand special forces officer and the wounding of former UFC fighter Tim Kennedy. The United Nations has warned that a window of opportunity for peace remains open in the DRC. The conflict remains deadly, with 1,158 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxQb3J5Sk1xdnNwNXYtQnlMOVhHU1l6SDdRUjZXenFGQWxLWVN3LWV5eXdfVWdWY0xfT1B3aU9GTEw4YUlVNndBZldKR3hQNkZ1M1BaTGR2YUp2RUE2NFZZWWdQQ08td2dfbmhqYkc3YkZtdk1aTTRaazBkRGs3WjBVMWhkc2ozX2hIel9qUG16QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQc2ZiMVBKRXV4T1U4Mkp2NFEyVHBnMGwtRktoZ09NYXBuaWdjOWo1ZzgxVk1sYUhTNS1sNkpuZmZ4N0dnbmltbmJYZGJoMVFYNVJ3SWtxTHh0VEttSW9ESVRNbmQ3Q3QzcnRHM1N2UXRfU3dnZDBnOGYzU3hCN2pBU21JLXBCT3JqdC1DdTVyRDgtZExGa0pUMnV3U2JqTFc0bmFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxQRTcxdks5amZ4b1FOdmpmY3RpVzZybk1fRExReTV5QlRTREtzWWo3R3IwbExNRTNud0I0SW5RUDRJRENUcGg2UnBNZ1hraDRyN3ZZemJ3NVRvRzFCN2l4RVZsQ05zck9SOXpCNE5CSHlaZFFidi1sTWFnSy1BQngwOXl0RS16YVdEbEItczhtanBZV0xObV91RGRkRVg3U1JxaHFMZFBHSjVBd3dJWDFZa2F4U3ZtVFhoVklrWV9mNGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The EastAfrican&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQQUxwalc3WXB5MkhxZUROZlNXUEFmVWstZ2NpUTV2bS04WjZNZ2tTUG85SGFLM005LXBfV25obnlPcjczVmU5SjdVTXRlcW8wa0piVFh4c0Q4ejdhN0ZlZWF0cjNxY1paQlVneUJrZURhTFlKQzFHZXNjczFFRGZHY1NVNkJsdjRzVVNUUDFCa1FHcE5qWnhPcTQ5aHpRNjF0UmxhZEJwTFB